EXPERIMENT 1 — PHONETIC ENGLISH
run against PREREG-phonetic.md; thresholds fixed before the corpus was built
STD corpus 4000000 chars, PHON corpus 4000000 chars

==============================================================================
P1 — MECHANISM STRENGTH (threshold: phonetic falls >= 0.20/gram under STD)
==============================================================================

  scored under the STANDARD quadgram model, 87-char windows:
    ordinary English  : -4.236 +- 0.136
    phonetic English  : -5.631 +- 0.304
    drop              : 1.395/gram
    deficit to explain: 0.444/gram  (section 7.3: Dorabella -4.680 vs -4.236)
    fraction of the deficit supplied: 314%

  P1 PASS (threshold 0.20)

