==============================================================================
P3 — POSITIVE CONTROL (threshold: >= 0.50 recovery; GATES P4)
==============================================================================

  Can the solver recover KNOWN enciphered phonetic English at n=87 when
  its fitness function is the phonetic model?  40 trials, 20x15000.

    phonetic English under PHON : score -4.197 +- 0.119   recovery 0.96  (median 0.99, >90%: 0.95)

  reference — the same control for ordinary English under the standard
  model, which is what licensed every interpretation in section 4:
    ordinary English under STD  : score -4.277 +- 0.207   recovery 0.94  (section 4.1 reported -4.196 +- 0.168, 0.96)

  P3 PASS (threshold 0.50 recovery)

