==============================================================================
SUMMARY AGAINST THE PRE-REGISTRATION
==============================================================================

  P1 mechanism strength   PASS   phonetic falls 1.395/gram under STD (>= 0.20)
  P2 adjacency survival   PASS   109% of the ceiling retained (>= 80%)
  P3 positive control     PASS   0.96 recovery at n=87 (>= 0.50)
  P4 the test             FAIL   z = -5.68 against the phonetic band (>= -1.90)

